# Laravel + Inertia

- Content is seeder-only (no Filament/admin)
- Locale prefix `/{locale?}` with `en|ar`; share `locale`, `dir`, `translations` via HandleInertiaRequests
- Controllers return Inertia pages; keep props typed and lean
- UI chrome strings live in `lang/en.json` + `lang/ar.json`
- DB translations for projects/experience/profile bios
- Contact form validates and stores to `contact_messages`
